### 看板概览（需先执行 samples/_login.http 登录）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dashboard/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 出勤趋势
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dashboard/attendance-trend?period=30d
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 班级排行
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dashboard/class-ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 成长统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dashboard/growth-stats?period=30d
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
